sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant OS as Android OS
    participant App as POS App
    participant Repo as Payment Repository
    participant DB as Encrypted Local Storage
    participant GW as Payment Gateway

    Note over App, Repo: Charge request was sent to gateway<br>but app terminated before receiving response

    OS ->> OS: App process killed / device restart
    OS ->> App: App restarted

    App ->> App: Initialize application
    App ->> Repo: Recover pending payment intents
    Repo ->> DB: Load pending payment intents
    DB -->> Repo: Pending intents<br>(amount, idempotencyKey, status=PENDING)

    loop For each pending intent (serialized per intent)
        Repo ->> Repo: Evaluate retry eligibility

        alt Retry without re-reading card
            Note right of Repo: High confidence request was sent or not sent<br>and card token still valid
            Repo ->> GW: Charge payment<br>(same idempotencyKey, same card token)

        else Card re-presentation required
            Note right of Repo: Outcome uncertain or token expired<br>EMV compliance requires re-presentation
            Note right of Repo: Do nothing (wait for user action)
        end

        alt Success (already processed or processed now)
            GW -->> Repo: Success (transactionId)
            Repo ->> DB: Update intent (COMPLETED, transactionId)

        else Failure (retryable=true)
            GW -->> Repo: Failure (error, retryable=true)
            Repo ->> DB: Update intent (PENDING, lastError=error)

        else Failure (retryable=false)
            GW -->> Repo: Failure (error, retryable=false)
            Repo ->> DB: Update intent (FAILED, lastError=error)

        else Timeout / Network error
            GW --x Repo: No response
        end
    end
